    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 — Abyssal Cartographers</strong></p><p><strong>“There are maps beneath the map.”</strong></p><p>Abyssal Cartographers chart what most people refuse to admit exists: drowned tunnels, pressure-cut caverns, forgotten ferry lines, and the strange geometry of places where water remembers older routes than roads do. They do not merely travel hidden ways. They prove those ways were always there.</p><p><em>You no longer discover secret routes. You administer a second geography.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Your Domain owns the hidden route logic: each water- or cavern-linked hex it holds also yields 10 extra Intrigue marks a turn.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
